  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u39b6ed3d\" id=\"u39b6ed3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u111bf97f\" id=\"u111bf97f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">键盘(</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud271919c\" id=\"ud271919c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04b32d77\" id=\"u04b32d77\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_keyboard</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue745da2e\" id=\"ue745da2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">)对象是一个特殊的按钮矩阵(</span><code data-lake-id=\"u55cbd8ee\" id=\"u55cbd8ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u375ec8f9\" id=\"u375ec8f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_btnmatrix</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6eb5fc9d\" id=\"u6eb5fc9d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">),自身实现了按钮(</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2f203c8d\" id=\"u2f203c8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb23ee50\" id=\"ucb23ee50\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">map</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u184d8878\" id=\"u184d8878\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">)映射和其他功能,目的是用于实现一个虚拟键盘将文本写入文本框(</span><code data-lake-id=\"u731dcb52\" id=\"u731dcb52\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube64314c\" id=\"ube64314c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">lv_textarea</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9e4389f3\" id=\"u9e4389f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">)。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"jaUas\" id=\"jaUas\"><span data-lake-id=\"u200a1560\" id=\"u200a1560\">1.常用方法</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u83f1d925\" id=\"u83f1d925\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca32fbf7\" id=\"uca32fbf7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">创建keyboard:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lv_obj_t%20*%20lv_keyboard_create(lv_obj_t%20*%20parent)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Jb8Pe%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u305e08f2\" id=\"u305e08f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u500b207d\" id=\"u500b207d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">关联textarea到keyboard:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_keyboard_set_textarea(lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20lv_obj_t%20*%20ta)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xNMZF%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"zVhPb\" id=\"zVhPb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1a8777aa\" id=\"u1a8777aa\">2.代码实现</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22static%20void%20ta_event_cb(lv_event_t%20*%20e)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_event_code_t%20code%20%3D%20lv_event_get_code(e)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_t%20*%20ta%20%3D%20lv_event_get_target(e)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_t%20*%20kb%20%3D%20lv_event_get_user_data(e)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(code%20%3D%3D%20LV_EVENT_FOCUSED)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lv_keyboard_set_textarea(kb%2C%20ta)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lv_obj_clear_flag(kb%2C%20LV_OBJ_FLAG_HIDDEN)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if(code%20%3D%3D%20LV_EVENT_DEFOCUSED)%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lv_keyboard_set_textarea(kb%2C%20NULL)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lv_obj_add_flag(kb%2C%20LV_OBJ_FLAG_HIDDEN)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20keyboard_1(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F*Create%20a%20keyboard%20to%20use%20it%20with%20an%20of%20the%20text%20areas*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_t%20*kb%20%3D%20lv_keyboard_create(lv_scr_act())%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F*Create%20a%20text%20area.%20The%20keyboard%20will%20write%20here*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_t%20*%20ta%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20ta%20%3D%20lv_textarea_create(lv_scr_act())%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_align(ta%2C%20LV_ALIGN_TOP_LEFT%2C%2010%2C%2010)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_add_event_cb(ta%2C%20ta_event_cb%2C%20LV_EVENT_ALL%2C%20kb)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_textarea_set_placeholder_text(ta%2C%20%5C%22Hello%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_set_size(ta%2C%20140%2C%2080)%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct%5Cn%20%20%20%20ta%20%3D%20lv_textarea_create(lv_scr_act())%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_align(ta%2C%20LV_ALIGN_TOP_RIGHT%2C%20-10%2C%2010)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_add_event_cb(ta%2C%20ta_event_cb%2C%20LV_EVENT_ALL%2C%20kb)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_set_size(ta%2C%20140%2C%2080)%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vdvqE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf5077ff7\" id=\"uf5077ff7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uffac4efc\" id=\"uffac4efc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">效果:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u18f8a8e3\" id=\"u18f8a8e3\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1681729040294-90cb5fc3-5cc7-4a08-8830-798da780fcc2.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uf09ead39-e541-4fdb-ac83-bf78e1a3655%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u263422dc-193b-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%2248.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A18399%2C%22from%22%3A%22drop%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A401%2C%22originHe